                   <decoDesc>
                       <decoNote xml:id="d1" type="miniature"><locus target="#5v"/><desc>Full-page coloured miniature depicting Moses with the tablets of the Law, together with Joshua and Aron. According to the caption below, the miniature was executed by the same scribe as the text (<persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15560Pawlos">Ṗāwlos</persName>): 
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ዘአሥዐለ፡ አቡነ፡ ገብረ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ማርያም፡ ወዘሠዓልክዎ፡ አነ፡ ጳውሎስ</q>.</desc>
                           <note>See also <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/9GPEF9VI"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:1993FiaccadoriMartini"/><title level="a">Bisanzio e il regno di ʾAksum. Sul manoscritto Martini etiop. 5 della Biblioteca Forteguerriana di Pistoia</title><title level="j">Bollettino del Museo Bodoniano di Parma</title><author><forename>Gianfranco</forename><surname>Fiaccadori</surname></author><date>1993</date><biblScope unit="volume">7</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">161-199</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:1993FiaccadoriMartini</note></note><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:1993FiaccadoriMartini</note></bibl>, <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/43BX858Q"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:1994FiaccadoriOttateuco"/><title level="a">Prototipi miniati dell’Ottateuco etiopico</title><title level="j">Bollettino del Museo Bodoniano di Parma</title><author><forename>Gianfranco</forename><surname>Fiaccadori</surname></author><date>1994</date><biblScope unit="volume">8</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">69-102</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Decoration</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:1994FiaccadoriOttateuco</note></note><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Decoration</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:1994FiaccadoriOttateuco</note></bibl></note></decoNote>
