               <history>
                  <origin>
                      According to the predominant interpretation of the colophon, the manuscript was produced 
                      <origDate notBefore="1438-02" notAfter="1438-07" evidence="internal-date">between February and July 1438 
                          (i.e. year of mercy 90)</origDate>, at the time of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10626ZaraY">Zarʾa Yāʿqob</persName> and 
                      <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS2469Bartalom">Bartalomewos</persName>.
                      The manuscript was probably produced in the monastery of <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC2357DabraS">Dabra Saqwǝrt</placeName> in
                      <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC5467Sahart">Saḥart</placeName>, Tǝgray
                      (cf. <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/9GPEF9VI"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:1993FiaccadoriMartini"/><title level="a">Bisanzio e il regno di ʾAksum. Sul manoscritto Martini etiop. 5 della Biblioteca Forteguerriana di Pistoia</title><title level="j">Bollettino del Museo Bodoniano di Parma</title><author><forename>Gianfranco</forename><surname>Fiaccadori</surname></author><date>1993</date><biblScope unit="volume">7</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">161-199</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:1993FiaccadoriMartini</note></note><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:1993FiaccadoriMartini</note><citedRange>163–164</citedRange></bibl>).
                      The commissioner of the manuscript was <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15559GabraMa">Gabra
               Māryām</persName>.
                  </origin>
                   <provenance> It came into possession of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6807Martini">Ferdinando Martini</persName> 
                       <date notBefore="1897" notAfter="1907">between 1897 and 1907</date> and was later acquired by the 
                       Biblioteca Forteguerriana between <date notBefore="1930" notAfter="1931">1930 and 1931</date>.
                       It is mentioned in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/XBDKDA79"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia"/><title level="m">Bibliografia etiopica, in continuazione alla «Bibliografia etiopica» di G. Fumagalli, II: Manoscritti etiopici</title><author><forename>Silvio</forename><surname>Zanutto</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Ministero delle Colonie–Sindacato Italiano Arti Grafiche</publisher><date>1932</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Bibliography</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopian studies</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia</note></note><note type="tag">Bibliography</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopian studies</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia</note><citedRange>81-84</citedRange></bibl>. 
                       It was first catalogued in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QJUEPTVG"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Lusini2002Pistoia"/><title level="a">I codici etiopici del fondo Martini nella Biblioteca Forteguerriana di Pistoia</title><title level="j">Aethiopica</title><author><forename>Gianfrancesco</forename><surname>Lusini</surname></author><date>2002</date><biblScope unit="volume">5</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">156-176</biblScope><note type="url">http://journals.sub.uni-hamburg.de/aethiopica/article/view/452</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Eritrea</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Manuscripts</note><note type="tag">Octateuch</note><note type="tag">Philology</note><note type="tag">Tigray</note><note type="tag">bm:Lusini2002Pistoia</note></note><note type="tag">Eritrea</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Manuscripts</note><note type="tag">Octateuch</note><note type="tag">Philology</note><note type="tag">Tigray</note><note type="tag">bm:Lusini2002Pistoia</note></bibl>. A detailed description of the manuscript is 
                       published in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/WAXY5FE4"><seg type="report"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Lusini2024Octateuch"/><title level="m">Pistoia, Biblioteca Forteguerriana, Martini etiop. 2, Ottateuco</title><title level="s" type="alternative">CaNaMEI Reports</title><author><forename>Gianfrancesco</forename><surname>Lusini</surname></author><author><forename>Gioia</forename><surname>Bottari</surname></author><author><forename>Jacopo</forename><surname>Gnisci</surname></author><author><forename>Massimo</forename><surname>Villa</surname></author><pubPlace>Naples</pubPlace><date>2024</date><series><title level="s" type="alternative">CaNaMEI Reports</title><biblScope unit="volume">5</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="page">1-34</biblScope><biblScope unit="volume">5</biblScope><note type="url">https://www.ipocan.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Report_5_CaNaMEI.pdf</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Lusini2024Octateuch</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Lusini2024Octateuch</note></bibl>.</provenance>
